# `npm start` only — read after .env*local files, before `.env` (earlier = wins for each key).
# Ensures 8001 when `.env` still had 8000. If 8000 persists, a `.env.local` or
# `.env.development.local` is overriding: fix or remove REACT_APP_API_URL there, then restart.
